<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Sumau Garia Bible - Unicode</book>
  <para style="h">Ep</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ep</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ep</para>
  <para style="toc1">Epesesi</para>
  <para style="ide"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="rem"/>
  <para style="h"/>
  <para style="mt">Polue Epesesi</para>
  <para style="mt2">xosaniki xayawotai nakau</para>
  <para style="imt">Akereki kuna</para>
  <para style="ip">Mua nakaupo nanunanu xotapa paiya muanumu Xoiteue xokupa sapi Kristusu xosa kununuwopurexina, paiya mena xouropu xokupa sapi xeika ouropu xeika kununuwatia, Kristusue xokupa sapi xiri tapaxi puropina. (1.10) Xoiteue nukou xuiapuni sainikerepurexina, kakatia ninie Kristusu xeika xiri etokineria kirenini xonikikemu puropineri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Akereki kuna masa paiya Xoiteupo xousua xeika xouwesikepi kapia xeikae kakati xokupa xuiapue Kristusure xonikisuwoteneaie xirini kunununeri kireni xuiapu kini sayeteneaire Polue xokupa kuna kunawotai. Yesusupo saina paie Xoiteue xuiapu xiyeri tinikina Xoiteupo Supo Youya tiniketai. Nukoe sokisoki kuna kunawoyai siena paiya nukoe xokupa asinaku kapia nini xosa kakepine xeyai. (1.14) Xoka axiri nakaupo kuna masa xosa Polue ipaki kunauna Yesusure xonikisuwoteneaie Kristusu xeika etokineri, pa xati ninie xiri kireni xonikikemu xineri Xoiteupo kapiani kutu taiwopineri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mua nakau xosa paiya xuiapu nini Kristusu xeika etokineri kireni xuiapu kini xineri xina yarani atarinikepure Polue kunaurouna. Nue ipaki kunauna Xoiteupo xuimiapimi paiya nini kireni mupuniki xati Kristusue pa mupunikipo tapakemu sie xetai. (4.1-16) Pa xeika Xoiteupo xuimiapimi paiya nini kire ata sie xati Kristusu nukoe atapu akereki xai xetai. (2.19-22) Xoiteupo xuimiapimi paiya nini kire xui sie xati Kristusue pa xuipo xamu sie xetai. (5.22-32) Mua nakau xosa paiya asinaku asinaku kapia Xoiteue nukou xuiapu xosa kakepure xetai xosa sikoe atinukuni kutu xekeurounuku.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="ms">Kristusu xosa Xoiteue sini oma xuiapu saisiketai</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="EPH 1-3">1—3</ref></para>
  <para style="d"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-21">YT 18.19-21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:1">19.1</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 1:1">Ro 1.1</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:7">1.7</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:1">1 Ko 1.1</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:1">Kl 1.1</ref></char></note> Polu, ye Kristusu Yesusupo tianuwopi. Nukoe ye xouweyati Xoiteue ye Yesusupo tianuwopi tumuyeretai. Tini Xoiteupo xuiapue Epesesi erewese purinuku Kristusu Yesusu taiwopi menamenaukiriai xosa mua nakau xayaritikine. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Sikou Emisiki Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:2">2 Ko 1.2</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 1:3">Ka 1.3</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:2">Kl 1.2</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 1:4">Ta 1.4</ref></char></note> xeika Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeikae, tini xonikietikineri xonikikemu tikeria tinipo xotikikemu yoroara puropina.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue Kristusu xosa xokupa mena xouropu asinaku sapi siketai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Sini <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:6">Ep 2.6</ref></char></note>Xoiteupo wenumu xourorepu, nu sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusupo Omo xeika nukou Xoiteu xeika. Sikou xenisiki tianuwopure, nukoe Yesusu wenumurei mena xouropu xokupa asinaku sapi siketai. <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:16">Yo 15.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:24">17.24</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:28">Ro 8.28</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:27">Ep 5.27</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:22">Kl 1.22</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 2:13">2 Ts 2.13</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:9">2 Ti 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="JAS 2:5">Ye 2.5</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:20">1 Pi 2.20</ref></char></note> xeseu puropure Xoiteue ou iyarepu xuweu yauseni, sini Kristusu xeika etokepure tumusikeretai. Kakeki xati sini nukou ekero kutu asinaku xu xuweu xuiapu puropu. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Yesusu Kristusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:12">Yo 1.12</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:29-30">Ro 8.29-30</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 6:18">2 Ko 6.18</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 4:5">Ka 4.5</ref></char></note> saina tina siko xiyeri tisikepinaure, ekimeni kutu nukoe xouwesikina nukou nononi kutu sayepure tumusikeretai. Xoiteue nukou nanunanuni nimaririeina taina panumu kaketai. <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Nukoe pa Nono xiri xouwewotai wenumurei<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mt 3.17</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yo 3.35</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 3:24">Ro 3.24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:15">5.15</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:13">Kl 1.13</ref></char></note>, Xoiteue xiri xouwesikina xoukemu sikeyai. Pa xati nue ere xouwesikina xoukemu siketaire nanunuku Xoiteupo wenumu xourorepu.<verse eid="EPH 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Xoiteue xouwesikina xoukemu sikepu kapia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:28">YT 20.28</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:7">Ep 2.7</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:14">Kl 1.14</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:20">1.20</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 9:12">Ip 9.12</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:18-19">1 Pi 1.18-19</ref></char></note> xiri xokopexina. Pa xati Kristusue sini xiyeri isayasikepure xumotai xati, nupo yawie sikou xokupa xunu Xoiteue xesauwetai. <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>Xoiteue xouwesikina xoukemu siketai kapia siko xosa panipani kusauna, xokupa xetaxetau sipa xeika asinaku nanunanu xeika siketai. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Ro 16.25</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:4">Ep 3.4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:9-11">3.9-11</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:26">Kl 1.26</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:9">2 Ti 1.9</ref></char></note> Xoiteue Kristusupo saina xosa mua kapia kakepure nanunanuwoyai. Pana nupo pa nanunanu paiya ximiaki puriyai xati ximine nupo nanunanu itou atarisikina. <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:22-23">1 Ko 3.22-23</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 4:4">Ka 4.4</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:9-10">Pl 2.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:16">Kl 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:20">1.20</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:2">Ip 1.2</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:20">1 Pi 1.20</ref></char></note> sapi kakepure xetaia muanumu. Xokupa sapi taitai xouna xouna, pa yause iyaretai xosa paiya, xokupa sapi mena xouropu xeika ouropu xeika rania Kristusu xosa kununuwopina. Kakatia Kristusue xokupa sapi tapaxi puropina.<verse eid="EPH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Xoiteu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:17">Ro 8.17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:28-29">8.28-29</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:12">Kl 1.12</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:7">Ta 3.7</ref>;<ref loc="JAS 2:5">Ye 2.5</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:4">1 Pi 1.4</ref></char></note> nukou xouweni nukou nanunanu taina xokupa sapi kakati marouna, kakina ekime nukou xouweni apimi Kristusu xeika etokinuku nupo xuiapu sayepinukure tumusikereyai. <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>Sinie akerinuku Kristusure xosikisunuku taikiri, nukou kokaipa memeremu xeika sokisoki xeika xosa sipesi nanunuku nukou wenumu xourorepinukure sini Xoiteue tumusikeretai.<verse eid="EPH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:22">2 Ko 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:7">6.7</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:30">Ep 4.30</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:4-6">Kl 1.4-6</ref></char></note> xetau xuiapu kini tinie rania suau kuna iyesieikiriai, paiya pa Xoiteupo asinaku kunae tini xiyeri titiketai. Kakati Kristusure xotikisunuku. Tinie nukou xuiapu kinini kutu purinuku, Kristusu xeika etokari, ekime Xoiteue sokisoki kuna kunawoyai taina Xoiteupo Supo Youya tiketai. <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:28">Lu 21.28</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:23">Ro 8.23</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 1:22">2 Ko 1.22</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pi 2.9</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo Supo Youya tieikiriai, pa xati siko sipa, Xoiteue kireu asinaku sapi nukou xokupa xuiapu tinikepure sokisoki kuna kunawoyai sie xurise sini rania tepu. Xoiteue xiyeri tisikati nuko xeika somoni kutu puropu yause xosa pa sapi tepure yakunuku. Kakinuku pa sokisoki saina tixanauwoyaire nanunuku nukou kokaipa wenumu xourorepu.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue Epesesi sipa tinikepinaure Polue kunikuniwotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:4">Kl 1.4</ref></char></note> Kokaipa Yesusure xotikisunuku Xoiteupo xokupa xuimiapimi xosa xotikikemu tinikirounuku kuna ye iyesitiai. <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 1:2-4">Pl 1.2-4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:3">Kl 1.3</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 1:2">1 Ts 1.2</ref></char></note> ye kunikuninepa, sipesi tinire nanunanune Xoiteu eiyaseuroune. Kakine <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>ye Xoiteu kotoutiai<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:9">Kl 1.9</ref></char></note>, nu Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusupo Xoiteu, nu kokaipa memeremu xeika sokisoki xeika nikau Eminiki. Nue asinaku nanunanu tikatia tinie nukou kuna xotapani kutu sipawari, nukoini kakatia, tini nupo xiri sipawakuai. <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:18">YT 26.18</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:12">Ep 2.12</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:4">4.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:12">Kl 1.12</ref></char></note> tinipo nanunanu xosa memeremu tikepinaure xoiyeune, kakatia tini takuai sapire yaitikatia atinari sipawakuai xine, paiya tinie yaku purikiriai sapire kunaune. Kakinaria Xoiteue sini nukou xuiapu xosa asinaku asinaku sapi iyarerisiketai sipawakuai. <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>Kakinari<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:7">Ep 3.7</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:11">Kl 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:29">1.29</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:12">2.12</ref></char></note> ipaki sipaunaria, mua Xoiteupo sokisokie sini nure sipesi xosikisuwopi saina tikiriai xuiapu xosa pani kokaipa saina tina xakuai. Sini nupo sokisoki uteiwopu xana xuweni kutu. Pa Xoiteupo kokaipa sokisoki sini xosa saina tirouna, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>paie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Siri 110.1</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 13:4">2 Ko 13.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:16">Kl 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:10-12">2.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:1">3.1</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:3">Ip 1.3</ref></char></note> sore ekime Kristusu xosa saina tetai. Kristusue xumurati, pa Xoiteupo kokaipa sokisokie sarina mena xouro sou xouna nukou xupo meruira miseretai. <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:38">Ro 8.38</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:9-10">Pl 2.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:10">Kl 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:15">2.15</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:4">Ip 1.4</ref></char></note> Kristusue xokupa xetau xetau yaniyani xouroni kutu puroto, xokupa tumu teu xouro puroto, xokupa kapmani xouro puroto, xokupa sapi sokisoki tuku teu xouro purotouna. Nue xokupa apimi mua yause xosa weniniki tuku xeika sewai yausepu xeika tuku xouro purina. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Siri 8.6</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mt 28.18</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:18">Kl 1.18</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 2:7">Ip 2.7</ref></char></note> xokupa sapi Kristusu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22-23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:18">Kl 1.18</ref></char></note> turo iyarina kawati, nue xokupa sapi tapaxi purati, pa kapiarei nu Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai nikau tumu purina. <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>Kristusure xonikisuwoteneai apimi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Ro 12.5</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:10">Ep 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:15">4.15</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:9">Kl 2.9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:11">3.11</ref></char></note> paiya nini Kristusupo mupokemu. Kristusue xokupa sapi minika purina xiri xokopexina, nue Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai apimi xosa xokope xetai.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Xoiteue kakati sini xumuweikiriai apimie Kristusu xeika ekisikioma purinuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:18">Ep 4.18</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:21">Kl 1.21</ref></char></note> ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:13">Kl 2.13</ref></char></note> xonuxonu xonuxonu xunu erari paie outikiati xumurounuku. <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>Pa yause xosa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yo 12.31</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:6">Ep 5.6</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:12">6.12</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:21">Kl 1.21</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:6-7">3.6-7</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:3">Ta 3.3</ref></char></note> tinie mua ouropu kapia xoxi xosa texikiniai. Kakinuku mena xouro puroteneai xoxi yaniyani nikau tumupo kapia tinie taikiniai, paiya pa sokisoki yaniyanie Xoiteupo kuna sokau porourouneri xuiapimi nikau kamunikiro xemu saina tina. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:12">Ro 5.12</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:16">Ka 5.16</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:6">Kl 3.6</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:3">Ta 3.3</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:3">1 Pi 4.3</ref></char></note> siko xokupae pa apimi kini xeika purinuku, sikou xipiki xosikie xouweurouna xoxi kapia kireni sini taikiriai. Sini pa xipiki xosikie xouweurouna kapia kireni tainuku sikou nanunanue xouwewotai kapia taiwotoukiriai. Sini panumu kaki purikiriai yause xosa panumu xoxi kapia xokupa xuiapue kakeri Xoiteue xoxi yause tinikepure ireyetai sini tiku.<verse eid="EPH 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4-5"/>Suau<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4-5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:24">Lu 15.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:32">15.32</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 15:11">YT 15.11</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 5:6-10">Ro 5.6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:4-5">6.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 6:13">6.13</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:12">10.12</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ep 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:1">2.1</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:7">2.7</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:12-13">Kl 2.12-13</ref></char></note>, sikou xoxi kapiae sini ousikiati xumuweikiriai. Sini xiri xumuweteneai apimi sie purinuku. Pana Xoiteue sini xouwesikina xoukemu siketai kapiae xiri koxetai. Nukoe kakati sini Kristusu xeika ekisikioma purinuku. Iyo, Xoiteue sini xouwesikina xoukemu siketai kapia kirenie tini xiyeri titiketai. <verse eid="EPH 2:4-5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:20">Ep 1.20</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:12">Kl 2.12</ref></char></note> Kristusu Yesusu xeika siko saisikeretai. Nue mena xouro nukou kokemu sai xosa Kristusu xeika miseisikeretai. <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>Kristusu Yesusupo saina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ep 1.7</ref></char></note> paie kakati nue mua asinaku kapia siko xosa kaketai, pa amure, xurise xokupa yause xosa xokupa apimi nukoe xiri xouwenikina xoukemu tiniketai kapia atarinikepurexina. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:10">Yo 4.10</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 4:16">Ro 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:14-17">10.14-17</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:29">Pl 1.29</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:9">2 Ti 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 6:4">Ip 6.4</ref></char></note> Kristusure xotikisuxari, Xoiteue tini xouwetikina xoukemu tiketai kapia kirenie, Xoiteue tini xiyeri titiketai. Paiya tini takieni kakikiriai sapixe. Xuwe. Xoiteue tini aini tiketai. <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>Paiya<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:20">Ro 3.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:27">3.27</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:2">4.2</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:29-31">1 Ko 1.29-31</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 1:9">2 Ti 1.9</ref></char></note> tini saina tinuku xe tikiriai sie xuwe. Pa xati kire apue nukou wenumuni xourorepuwatixe. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Kristusu Yesusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:9">1 Ko 3.9</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 5:5">2 Ko 5.5</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:17">5.17</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:24">Ep 4.24</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 2:14">Ta 2.14</ref></char></note> kakati Xoiteue sini oma xuimiapimi saisikeretai, paiya siko asinaku kapiapu imerei texepure ekimeni Xoiteue ireiyerisikeyai ime.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kristusue xiwai kapia xuweiyati aimore kinie kireni tutuxineri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:28-29">Ro 2.28-29</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:2">1 Ko 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:8">Ep 5.8</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:21">Kl 1.21</ref></char></note> sipa, Yuta apimie apimi nikau mupuniki ipisa kakirounerie, tini ipaki kakikirouneri, “Nini mupuniki ipisa katiwopu xuweu apimi,” xirouneri. Paiya apimie nikou mupuniki masaureni mamarikaurounerire kunawotai. Paina tini atinari nanuwa, ekime tini xetau xeteneai xuiapu purinuku, <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>pa yause xosa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:4">Ro 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:8">9.8</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 4:8">Ka 4.8</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:18">Ep 4.18</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:21">Kl 1.21</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:5">1 Ts 4.5</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 4:13">4.13</ref></char></note> Kristusu nutiemu puropu xuwe. Tini Israili kini xeika puropu xuwena kisau purikiniai. Xoiteue Israili xeika sokisoki kuna kunarina nini xeika kuna ouna xoniki tumareyaina tini paiya nini xeika purarixe. Tini mua ouro purinuku, sewai kire asinaku sapi purotai putawopina tini yakuwarixe. Pa xeika tini Xoiteu sipa xuwe. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Ka 3.28</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:17">Ep 2.17</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:20">Kl 1.20</ref></char></note> tini xetauroni kutu purikiniai. Pana muaiya Kristusupo yawie sotiki koati, Xoiteu nuko nutiemuni kutu purinuku. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Kristusu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">Ais 9.6</ref>;<ref loc="MIC 5:5">Mai 5.5</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 16:33">Yo 16.33</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 10:36">YT 10.36</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:13">1 Ko 12.13</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:20">Kl 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:14">2.14</ref></char></note> nukoini kakirouwati sini xosikikururei xirini ati misinuku. Ekime Yuta kinie xetau xeteneai apimi xeika xiwaixirouneri, kakeri pa xiwai kapia paie sepuri sie Yuta kini xeika xetau xeteneai apimi kini xeika purotai. Pana Kristusu nukou mupoini pa sepuri kereuweina pa xiwai kapia xuweiyeina, pa aimore kini kunununikerina kireni kini nikeretai. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:17">2 Ko 5.17</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 6:15">Ka 6.15</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:24">Ep 4.24</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:20-22">Kl 1.20-22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:14">2.14</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:20">2.20</ref></char></note> Mosesipo tuxotapa xeika xokupa kuna masa xeika nupo kireu xetau tuxotapa xeika xesauwetai. Nue aimore kini kunununikerina, kireni apu sieinikerepure pa kapia kaketai. Nue pa kapia kaketai xati sini xosiki tumaxi purinuku. <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>Kireni<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:10">Sek 9.10</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 6:6">Ro 6.6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:3">8.3</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:20">Kl 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:14">2.14</ref></char></note> mupoe pa aimore kinie Xoiteu xeika xoniki tumaxi puropinerire na nikitoto xosa xumotai. Kakina ekime puroyai xiwai kapia na nikitoto xosa xumuwetai. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Ais 57.19</ref>;<ref loc="ZEC 9:10">Sek 9.10</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 2:39">YT 2.39</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 5:1">Ro 5.1</ref></char></note> kouna asinaku kuna ipaki uteina, “Tini ximine xotikikemu kirenini pura,” xetai. Nue mua asinaku kuna tini xetauro wese purixanaukiriai apimi kini xosa uteiwotowotai, tomuroni puroteneai xuiapu xosa rania uteiwotai. <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:2">Ro 5.2</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:13">1 Ko 12.13</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:12">Ep 3.12</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 4:16">Ip 4.16</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:18">1 Pi 3.18</ref></char></note> wesikitati nukou xosa xouwopure, Kristusue panumu kakati Xoiteupo Youyae sini aimore tutuni tianisiketai.<verse eid="EPH 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sini Yesusu taikiriai sini Xoiteupo atani kutu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Muaia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:10">Ka 6.10</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 3:6">Ep 3.6</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 3:20">Pl 3.20</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 12:22-23">Ip 12.22-23</ref></char></note> tini ou xuweu kamariorio puroteneai apimi siexe. Xuwe. Tini Xoiteupo xuiapu tuku kireni kinipu purinuku. Tini Xoiteupo xuiapuni kutu purinuku. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:18">Mt 16.18</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 3:9-11">1 Ko 3.9-11</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 2:9">Ka 2.9</ref>;<ref loc="REV 21:14">XKY 21.14</ref></char></note> Xoiteue xuwotai ata sie. Mua atapu xai sie nue sini Yesusupo tianutianuwopi xeika kunatureture xeika waisikereyai. Yesusu Kristusu nuko paiya akereki xaini kutu. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Mua atapu xokupa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16-17">1 Ko 3.16-17</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Ko 6.16</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:15-16">Ep 4.15-16</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:19">Kl 2.19</ref></char></note> arawae Kristusu xosa wawaiwoki, kakineri xokupani atineri wawaiwoteneai. Xoiteue pani pa ata xuwati, Xoiteu nukou atani puropinaure pa ata xiri kokaipa xepurexina. <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:5">1 Pi 2.5</ref></char></note> rania Kristusu xosa wawaiwari, Xoiteue nukou kireu xuiapu xeika kununuwati, tini Xoiteupo atani kutu xatia, nuko xeika Xoiteupo Supo Youya xekae pa atoro puropineri.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Polue xetau xeteneai apimi xosa asinaku kuna uteiwopina saina tuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:1">Ep 4.1</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:7">Pl 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 1:13">1.13</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:1">Pm 1</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:9">9</ref></char></note> tini xiri asinakuni kutu saitiketai xati, pa xotapaure sore ye Polu ye kakauya xosa purine pa amure, tini xetau xeteneai xuiapu tianitikepure Kristusu Yesusupo saina tiroune. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:25">Kl 1.25</ref></char></note> xosa rania pa saina kakina xouwetikina xoukemu tiketai sie, yei pa saina tepineure Xoiteue ye xouweina xoukemu sierina tumuyeretaire, tini iyesikiriaixi nanune. <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>Mua<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:9-10">Ep 1.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:26">Kl 1.26</ref></char></note> kuna Xoiteue ekime kakeyai kapiaure paiya ximiaki puroyaina pana, Xoiteu nukoini ye xosa yarareyai paiya, ye xayaka xayaka kunauweitiai. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Kristusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:26-27">Kl 1.26-27</ref></char></note> ximiarei pa saina tetaire kuna ye xiri sipani kutuna, tinie mua kuna ninaxinaria tini panumu sipawakuai. <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>Ekime xokupa yause xosa, Xoiteue mua ximiaropu kuna atina uteiwopu xuwe. Pana muaia Xoiteupo Supo Youya xosa, Xoiteue sini Yesusupo tianuwopi xeika Xoiteupo kunatureture xeika xosa atina kuna uteiwotai. <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>Mua<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:14">Ka 3.14</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:28-29">3.28-29</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:13-19">Ep 2.13-19</ref></char></note> kuna paiya muanumu. Asinaku kuna xosa paie tini xetau xeteneaipo apimi kinie sini xeika kireni kini xinuku kireni mupusiki sainuku. Kakinuku siko xokupae Kristusu Yesusu xosa Xoiteue xokupa sapi akituworisikeyai tirounuku. <verse eid="EPH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>Yei mua asinaku kuna uteiwopineure Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:23-25">Kl 1.23-25</ref></char></note> kakati ye saina apu saitiai. Nue ye xouweina xoukemu sierina, nue sokisokiyati pa saina tepineure, nupo sokisoki ye sietai. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:9-10">1 Ko 15.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 1:16">Ka 1.16</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:7">Ep 1.7</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:27">Kl 1.27</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 1:13-15">1 Ti 1.13-15</ref></char></note> paiya Xoiteupo kireu xuiapu irueni kutu purinena pana, nue ye xouweina xoukemu sierina pa saina sietai, paiya xetau xeteneai apimi xosa kuna uteiwopineure. Mua asinaku kuna paiya, asinaku sapi nikau, paiya Kristusu taiwoteneai xuiapue tepineri. Mua xokupa sapi paiya sini apue uteinuku ninaxepu sie xuwe. <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Ro 16.25</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 2:7">1 Ko 2.7</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:9">Ep 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:16">Kl 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:20">1.20</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 1:2">Ip 1.2</ref></char></note> xokupa sapi iyarina, ximuximuni nukoe kapia kakepurexeyai nanunanu ximiakereyai. Kakati ekime pa nanunanu sipesi ximiaki purotai. Pana muaia yei nupo nanunanu yarani uteiwopineure saina sietai. <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>Ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:38">Ro 8.38</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 11:33">11.33</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:21">Ep 1.21</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:12">1 Pi 1.12</ref></char></note> ximiakereyaina pana, muaia nukoe kakati nukoure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu putawori, pa kapiarei nupo xokupa xokupa asinaku nanunanu xeika sipa xeika yaraxeri, mena xouropu sokisoki yaniyani xeika tumu xeikae Xoiteupo nanunanu sipawopineri. <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>Ekimeni Xoiteue mua saina kakepure nanuwoyai xati, ximine sikou Kokaipa Kristusu Yesusupo sainae saina tietai. <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>Kakati <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:6">Yo 14.6</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 5:2">Ro 5.2</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:18">Ep 2.18</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 4:16">Ip 4.16</ref></char></note>sini Kristusure xosikisunuku, sini ximikiroukirixe. Sini xiri sipa, Kristusu nu Xoiteu xosa putawopu ime. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:24">Kl 1.24</ref></char></note> ye ximine tini katikine, tini tianitikepure mua tatau xemetiaire xekepi nanunanuwari, tinipo xotikisu oro koxete. Xuwe. Mua sapi yaraxetaire tini nimaririwa, pa amure, tini Xoiteu xeika ati purakuaire tianitikepina.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Epesesie sokisoki puropinerire Polue kunikuniwotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Xauwae kakeyai kapiaure nanune nure xoitapa ukurouroune. <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:10">Ep 1.10</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:9-11">Pl 2.9-11</ref></char></note> xokupa kini mena xouro puroto ouro purotowoteneai nikau Eminiki xati, nukoini nini xokupa weniniketai. <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>Yei<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:23">Ro 9.23</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 4:16">2 Ko 4.16</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 4:19">Pl 4.19</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:11">Kl 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:27">1.27</ref></char></note> xoitapa ukuroune ipaki kunikunine, Xauwae tini asinaku asinaku sapini kutu tikepure akituworitiketai, pa xati nukou Supo Youya tinipo xotikiro koratia tini xiri sokisokini kutu purakuai xiroune. <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>Tinipo xotikisue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:23">Yo 14.23</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:22">Ep 2.22</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:23">Kl 1.23</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:7">2.7</ref></char></note> kakatia Kristusue tinipo xotikiro puropina. Kakatia kireu xiri xonikiewopi kapia paie, tinipo xotikikemu tuporo xiri sokisokina paiya ouwe na poru soki tati nae soki tumurouna sie kakatia tini sokisoki tumuwakuai. <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18-19"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.18-19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:16">Yo 1.16</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 10:3">Ro 10.3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 10:11-12">10.11-12</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:18">Ep 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:23">1.23</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:2">Kl 2.2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:9-10">2.9-10</ref></char></note> tinie Xoiteupo xuiapu xeika sokisoki takuai, kakinari Kristusue kireu xiri xouwenikepi kapia paiya, xiri kokaipani kutu xati, tini xokupae atinari sipawakuai, paiya pani xuwau xouna, xouroni kutu xouna, taipa toupaini xouna. Iyo, Kristusue kireu xouwenikepi kapia paiya xokupa sipa xiri emeserinikinana pana, tini nu xiri sipawakuai. Kakinaria xokupa asinaku sapi Xoiteu nuko xosauni koxetai paiya, tini xosa rania koxepineri.<verse eid="EPH 3:18-19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Xoiteupo sokisokieni<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:25">Ro 16.25</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 2:9">1 Ko 2.9</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:29">Kl 1.29</ref></char></note> sikou xosikiro saina tirouna xati, pa sokisokie sikou nanunanu xiri emeserina. Xoiteue xokupa sapi kakepinaure kotourounukua, nini Xoiteupo sokisoki sieni kutu xepuworixe. <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Ro 11.36</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:27">16.27</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:21">Ip 13.21</ref></char></note> Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapue, sipesi sipesi Kristusu Yesusupo wenumurei Xoiteupo wenumu xokupa yause rania xourorepineri. Pa suau.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="ms">Sini Kristusupo mupokemu purinuku sini Xoiteu nukou kapiani taiwopu</para>
  <para style="mr">
    <ref loc="EPH 4-6">4—6</ref></para>
  <para style="d"/>
  <para style="s">Sini Yesusure xosikisukiriai apimi xosiki tumaxi puropu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Ye<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 3:1">Ep 3.1</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:27">Pl 1.27</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:10">Kl 1.10</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 2:12">1 Ts 2.12</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:1">Pm 1</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:9">9</ref></char></note> Polu ye kakauya xosa purine, pa amure, ye Kokaipapu saina tiroune. Xoiteue nukoni kutu taiwakuaire yaitikeyaire ye nanune, pa xati nukoe xouwewotai asinaku kapiarei texakuaire xakumetikepurexine. <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>Kireu apimi nini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:19">YT 20.19</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:22-23">Ka 5.22-23</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:12-13">Kl 3.12-13</ref></char></note> Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai irueni kutu tini purinari, asinaku kapia nini xosa kaka. Tini xosa kapia xoreiyereri kakixanari nini xosa kisamairatikexete. Tini kireni kirenie tinipo xotikikemu nini tinikinari ninie tini tiketeneai xu xemeroa. <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>Xoiteupo Supo Youyae<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:14-15">Kl 3.14-15</ref></char></note> xosikikemu kirenini tumaxi puropu kapia sikati, pa kapiae muri sie taisikerati kireni kinipuere sini purinuku. Pa xati tini pa kapia soki tepure sokisokixa. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Mupusiki kireni tuku<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Ro 12.5</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:4">1 Ko 12.4</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:11-12">12.11-12</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:18">Ep 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:16-18">2.16-18</ref></char></note>, Xoiteupo Supo Youya kireni tuku. Panumu sie tini kireni sapi kireni yakuwakuaire Xoiteue yaitikina, paiya Xoiteue siko xosa kakepurexetai asinaku sapi xousokuwopina. <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>Kireni Kokaipa kireni purina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:16">Yo 10.16</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 1:13">1 Ko 1.13</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 11:4">2 Ko 11.4</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 3:27-28">Ka 3.27-28</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 6:6">Ip 6.6</ref></char></note>, xosikisuwopi kapia kireni, Xoiteupo wenumurei ene isepi kireni. <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Kireni Xoiteu tuku<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:36">Ro 11.36</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:6">1 Ko 12.6</ref></char></note>, nu siko xokupa sikau Emisiki. Nue xokupa xuiapu oronikina, nue xokupa xuiapu xopuro saina tina, xokupa xuiapu xosa purina.<verse eid="EPH 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Kristusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:3">Ro 12.3</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:6">12.6</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:11">1 Ko 12.11</ref></char></note> kokaipa sokisoki xeika sipa xeika siko siketai xati, panumu sieni Xoiteue siko xokupa kireni kireni xouwesikina xoukemu siketai. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Xoiteupo nakaue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:18">Siri 68.18</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:15">Kl 2.15</ref></char></note> ipaki kunauna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Nue xouroni kutu xouna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">kokaipa kakauya apimi kini sonikati</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EPH 4:8">nuko xeika xowoteneai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">Kakina sokisoki xeika sipa xeika</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EPH 4:8">apimi tiniketai,” xetai.<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>Mua<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:13">Yo 3.13</ref></char></note> kuna “nu xouro xowotai” paiya Kristusu nu xouro kireni xowopu xuwexi atarisikina. Xuwe. Ximuximua nu ou toupai miniminikani kutu purotai xosa xowotai. <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Pa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:14">Ip 4.14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:24">9.24</ref></char></note> apue ximuximu ou minika xowotaieni, xouro rania xowotai. Nue xokupa sapi inainawopure, xokupa mena xouroni kutu xowotai. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:7">Ro 12.7</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 12:28">1 Ko 12.28</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:5">2 Ti 4.5</ref></char></note> sore muanumu sokisoki xeika sipa xeika siketai. Kireu apimi xosa paiya Yesusupo tianutianuwopi saina tiniketai. Kireu apimi xosa paiya kunatureture saina tiniketai. Kireu xosa paiya xuiapu xosa asinaku kuna uteiwopineri saina tiniketai. Kireu xosa paiya yayakunikepi saina tinikete Xoiteue xouwewotai kapia xuiapu taitainikepineri saina tiniketewotai. <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>Sini Xoiteupo xuiapue nukou asinaku saina tepuxati Kristusue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:7">1 Ko 12.7</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:23">Ep 1.23</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 3:17">2 Ti 3.17</ref></char></note> sokisoki xeika sipa xeika tianisikepure siketai. Pa xati Kristusupo mupokemu sokisoki xinapa ati puropina. <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Mua<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:20">1 Ko 14.20</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:28">Kl 1.28</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:2">2.2</ref></char></note> sainae xowoki xowoki wati xosikisukiri paie kakatia, sini xiri xosikikemu tumaxi purinuku siko xokupani Xoiteupo Nono sipawopu. Kakinuku Yesusure xosikisunuku sokisokixinukua Kristusu nuko sieni asinaku kapia tepu. <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:9">Ais 28.9</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 14:20">1 Ko 14.20</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 2:17">2 Ko 2.17</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:9">Ip 13.9</ref></char></note> nono misiarara sie pani puropuxe, pa xakuxakutua nikau kuna paiya nini xoreixepineri xokupa kapia xiri sipani kutu, paie kakati xupeu xeika xasi xeikae sini xosa sokau porourouna sie porosikepuwatixe, ousoe xasi ukauro kamariorio tiririkixanauna xowopurexetai wese xowopu xuweurouna sie xuwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Sini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22">Ep 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:25">4.25</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:18">Kl 1.18</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 3:18">1 Yo 3.18</ref></char></note> panumu kuna xosa xakusiki iyarepuxe. Xuwe. Sini kireu xiri xonikiewopi kapia tainuku nini xosa suau kuna kireni kunawopu. Kakinuku sokisoki xuiapu sainuku, siko tapusiki Kristusu xeika xiri lixepu, <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>nue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:19">Kl 2.19</ref></char></note> kakati sikou mupusikipo xokupa xupusiki siasiki ekisiki paiya nukoe siko kireni kireni saina siketai xati asinaku saina tirounuku. Nue kakati siko xokupa xosikitapapu tunie xiri kiritinuku kireu xatasikimana xosikienikepi kapia tairouna, pa kapia paie kakati mupusiki kokaipaxina sokisokixirouna.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu nini oma kapia xosa texepineri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:21">Ro 1.21</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 1:14">1 Pi 1.14</ref></char></note> ye tini xosa kire kuna kunawopure xine. Kokaipapu wenumurei ye ipaki sokisoki kuna kunaune, tini xukumi nikau kapia xosa pani texaku. Ninipo nanunanu paiya turutaruwati, <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>ninipo sipa paiya<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:18">YT 26.18</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 4:8">Ka 4.8</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:12">Ep 2.12</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:5">1 Ts 4.5</ref></char></note> ukumu sie xina. Nini sipa xiri xuwe xati, xonikikemu kitiere, pa xati nini Xoiteupo misepirei purorixe. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Nini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:5">Kl 3.5</ref></char></note> xoxixoxi kapia kakerineri paire mayaxirouworixe. Nini ayaka kapia kamatupo xosa maneri, xoxixoxi kapia kakepure xonikemu sana.<verse eid="EPH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20-21"/>Tini Kristusupo kuna iyesari, Yesusu xosa purotai suau kuna taitaitiketeneaixi nanune. Paina ye sipa, tinie pa xukumi nikau kapia xoxi kakakuaire taitaitikepu xuwe. <verse eid="EPH 4:20-21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Tini rania ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:6">Ro 6.6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:13">8.13</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:2-3">Ep 2.2-3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:17">4.17</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:9">Kl 3.9</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 12:1">Ip 12.1</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 4:3">1 Pi 4.3</ref></char></note> xipiki xotikikemupo kapia xosa texikiniai, paiya xoreiyeri xosiki saroati xoxi kapia kakepi xotapa, pa kapiae apu xoxixepina ime yatawotai. Pana ximine tini mua xipiki kapia kakepi xotapa xesauwari, <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>tinipo nanunanu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Ro 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:10">Kl 3.10</ref></char></note> oma xepina. <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Stt 1.26</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 6:4">Ro 6.4</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:10">Ep 2.10</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:10">Kl 3.10</ref></char></note> oma xuiapu saya, paiya Xoiteu nukoini kakati oma xuiapu saineri Xoiteu nuko sieni purineri, pa amure, Xoiteu nuko ekero ninipo kapia paiya xiri teteiwoki xoseini kutu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:16">Sek 8.16</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 12:5">Ro 12.5</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:8-9">Kl 3.8-9</ref></char></note> tini xoreixepi kapia weta. Tini xokupae kireu xuiapu Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xosa suau kuna kireni kunawa, pa amure, siko xokupa paiya kireni mupusikipo masa purinuku. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Tini kisamairatikatia<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:4">Siri 4.4</ref>;<ref loc="JAS 1:19-20">Ye 1.19-20</ref></char></note>, tini sosopa epixakuai. Panumu tini xunu eraku. Panumu tini kisamaira xosa purariporoni asau munoxete. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Panumu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 2:10-11">2 Ko 2.10-11</ref>;<ref loc="JAS 4:7">Ye 4.7</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:9">1 Pi 5.9</ref></char></note> tini Satanipo isima taiyaku. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Petuae<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 4:11">1 Ts 4.11</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 3:8">2 Ts 3.8</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:11-12">3.11-12</ref></char></note> pani pexeni. Xuwe. Nini mua saina ati tineri, xokupa sapi tineria, kireu apimi xuru xuweu puroteneai tianikepineri. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:4">Ep 5.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:8">Kl 3.8</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:16">3.16</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:6">4.6</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:11">1 Ts 5.11</ref></char></note> kakixanari xoxixoxi ninia tinipo suputikerei wetari koxete. Xuwe. Apimi irerewoteneai sokisokinikepure, asinaku kuna kireni kopina. Muanumu kuna paie kuna iyeseteneai apimi xosa Xoiteue xouwesikina xoukemu sikirouna kapia kopina. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Ais 63.10</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:23">Ro 8.23</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:13-14">Ep 1.13-14</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:19">1 Ts 5.19</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo Supo Youya kakixari xoukemu tutumuriwaku. Xoiteu nukou xuiapuni kutu purakuaire yekutikina Xoiteupo Supo Youya tiketai, kakina xiyeri sotikati somoni kutu purakuai yause ataritikepurexina. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:8">Kl 3.8</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18-19">3.18-19</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:2-3">Ta 3.2-3</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:1">1 Pi 2.1</ref></char></note> xokupa xotikikemu xoxixoxixepi kapia wetinari, makawopi wetinari, kisamaira wetinari, xatiki kopuwopi wetinari, pire wetinari, xokupa kapia xoxi weta. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mt 6.14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:22-35">18.22-35</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 11:25">Mk 11.25</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 2:10">2 Ko 2.10</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:13">Kl 3.13</ref></char></note> Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu xotikikemu tinikinari nini xosa asinaku kapia kakinari, takitaki tianuwataxa. Xoiteue Kristusu wenumurei tinipo xunu wetetai sie, tinie ninipo xunu wetakuai.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Sini memeremu xosauni kutu texepu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mt 5.48</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 6:36">Lu 6.36</ref></char></note> tini xiri xouwetikirouna xati, tini nupo nono purinuku. Pa xati nukoe kakirouna kapiani tini taiwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>Kristusue siko xiri xouwesikina tianisikepure nukou ekeomani siketai. Nue Xoiteu xosa xouiwori asinaku xurituku sapie somu xuri pukaurouna sie nukou ekeoma Xoiteu tuwotai. Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">XT 29.18</ref>;<ref loc="LEV 1:9">XS 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="PSA 40:6">Siri 40.6</ref>;<ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yo 13.34</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 14:15">Ro 14.15</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 2:15">2 Ko 2.15</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 2:20">Ka 2.20</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 7:27">Ip 7.27</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:10">10.10</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 3:11">1 Yo 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">3.23</ref></char></note> tinie kireu xiri xoutikieninikepi kapiani kuturei texa.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:13">Ro 6.13</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 5:1">1 Ko 5.1</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 12:21">2 Ko 12.21</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:5">Kl 3.5</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:3">1 Ts 4.3</ref></char></note> kakixanari ayaka ayaka kapia kakinari xokupa xoxixoxi xunu kapia kakinari, kireu apimi nikau sapire ekitikie netewaku. Pa xoxixoxi kapiapu kuna rania tini xopuro xayaka xayaka moxete. Tinie panumu kapia kakinari ime taiyaria xuiapue tini kuna xosatiki suwopineri. <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:35">Mt 12.35</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 1:28">Ro 1.28</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:29">Ep 4.29</ref></char></note> kakixanari xunu kuna kunaunari nanana kuna kunaunari neraunari ninia kuna kunawaku. Sini panumu kapia xoxi kakepuxe. Xuwe. Xoiteu xosa kireni eiyase kuna kunawa. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:9-10">1 Ko 6.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 5:19-21">Ka 5.19-21</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:5">Kl 3.5</ref></char></note> panumu atinari sipawa, ayaka kapia kakineri xunu kapia kakepineri xuiapu xeika ekinikie sapi nirouneri xuiapu xeika nini xorei xoiteu xosa muris tepi sie kapia kakineri, nini panumu xuiapu kinia nini Kristusuno Xoiteunoe xuiapu yakunikepineri yause xosa manepuworixe.<verse eid="EPH 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:18">Ro 1.18</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:4">Kl 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:8">2.8</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 2:3">2 Ts 2.3</ref></char></note> sosopa epixa, apimie purutikeri pa xoxi kapia xona kakakuaire katikeri ninipo inainaropu aipu kuna xoxi taiwaku. Panumu kapia sore kakeri Xoiteue xasese maneteneai apimi xosa kisamairauna. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Pa xati tini panumu apimi xeika kakixanari lixaku. <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>Tini ekime<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:36">Yo 12.36</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 26:18">YT 26.18</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 1:21">Ro 1.21</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 3:18">2 Ko 3.18</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 2:11-13">Ep 2.11-13</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:13">Kl 1.13</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pi 2.9</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 2:9">1 Yo 2.9</ref></char></note> ukumu xosa purikiniai, pana muaia Kokaipae memeremu xosa iyaitikeretai. Pa xati tini memeremu xosaupo xuiapu sie xosa texa. <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>Memeremu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:22">Ka 5.22</ref></char></note> paie xokupa asinaku kapia xeika kutu asinaku kapia xeika suau kunapu kapia xeika yararirouna. <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Ro 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:10">Pl 1.10</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:21">1 Ts 5.21</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 2:3">1 Ti 2.3</ref></char></note> Kokaipae xouweurouna kapia sipawopure xaute sokisokixa. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:21">Ro 6.21</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 5:9-11">1 Ko 5.9-11</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 6:8">Ka 6.8</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 3:6">2 Ts 3.6</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 3:14">3.14</ref>;<ref loc="2JN 1:10-11">2 Yo 10-11</ref></char></note> ukumu xosaupo kapia kakirouneri apimi xeika lixaku. Panumu kapiae asinaku xoye erirouwatixe. Xuwe. Xeuxana, tinie apimi panumu atarinikinari, muanumu kapia xoxi nika. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Ninie ximiakineri kakirouneri kapiaure ye kunawopure xuwe. Ye panumu kapiaure kunawopinepa ye mayaxine. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Pana<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:20-21">Yo 3.20-21</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 4:13">Ip 4.13</ref></char></note> memeremue xokupa kapia xotapa yararatia yarani purirouneri. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Memeremue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:19">Ais 26.19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:1">60.1</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 13:11">Ro 13.11</ref></char></note> kakati kire sapi yarani puratia, pa sapi rania memeremu siexina. Pa xati mua kuna purina,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“Apu ne mua xinitiaia, ne sarouwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Ne kopa upurei saroaua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Kristusue ne memeremu</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EPH 5:14">tinepina,” xetai.<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Pa xati tini sesepi texinaria tini sosopani epixakuai. Tini nanana xinari sipa xuweu apue teiyewaku. Xuwe. Tini sipa tuku apue teiyewa. <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 6:10">Ka 6.10</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:5">Kl 4.5</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo kapia kakakuai yause muai. Pana sini mua yause xosa purikiriai paiya xoxi yause, pa xati sosopa xakuai, panumu mau yause aini xuwexete. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Ro 12.2</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:9">Kl 1.9</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 4:3">1 Ts 4.3</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:18">5.18</ref></char></note> kakixanari nanana kapia kakaku. Xuwe. Tini Xoiteue xouwewotai nanunanu atinari sipawakuai.<verse eid="EPH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 20:1">Asin 20.1</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 5:11">Ais 5.11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:22">5.22</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 21:34">Lu 21.34</ref></char></note> kakixanari xisa ere ninari nanana xaku. Xuwe. Panumu kapiae tini xoxirounuku. Tini Xoiteupo Youya wetari tini xosa koxepina. <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:1">Siri 34.1</ref>;<ref loc="ACT 16:25">YT 16.25</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 14:26">1 Ko 14.26</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:16-17">Kl 3.16-17</ref></char></note>Xoiteupo kireu xuiapu xeika kunaunari paiya, siri Siri Nakau xosa puroteneai kuna tete muris tepupo kireu siri tete, Xoiteupo Supo Youyae xotikiro saretai siri teteunari, tinipo kuna xosa iyara. Kakinari tinipo suputikirei xeika xotikirei xeika rania, tini Kokaipaure siri wawaiwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Kakinari<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:1">Siri 34.1</ref>;<ref loc="ISA 63:7">Ais 63.7</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 13:15">Ip 13.15</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:5">1 Pi 2.5</ref></char></note> sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusupo wenumurei, tini sipesi xokupa sapire Xauwa Xoiteu eiyasewa.<verse eid="EPH 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue xuiapue tiwataxeteneaire kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Pl 2.3</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:5">1 Pi 5.5</ref></char></note> Kristusu sinipo Kokaipaxi nanunari, tini kireni kirenie Xoiteupo kireu xuiapu irue pura.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:16">Stt 3.16</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 6:5">Ep 6.5</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:18">Kl 3.18</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Pi 3.1</ref></char></note> xuia, tini Kokaipa irue purikiriai sie takipo xamutikimana irue pura. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Pa amure<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:3">1 Ko 11.3</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Ep 1.22-23</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:18">Kl 1.18</ref></char></note>, Kristusue nukoure xonikisuwoteneai nikau tumu sie, apue nupo xui tapaxina. Yesusure xonikisuwoteneaia Kristusupo mupokemu xati, Kristusue xiyeri sowotai. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Yesusure xonikisuwoteneaia Kristusu irue purineri. Panumu sie tini xui rania, xokupa yause tinipo xamutikimana irue pura.<verse eid="EPH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Kristusue nukoure xonisuwoteneai tianikepure xiri xouwenikina nupo ekeoma wetetai sie, tini apue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:4">Ka 1.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:19">Kl 3.19</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Pi 3.7</ref></char></note> rania tinipo xui xiri xotikienika. <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Nukou ene xeika kuna xeika xosa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:3">Yo 15.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:17">17.17</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:5">Ta 3.5</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 10:10">Ip 10.10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:22">10.22</ref>;<ref loc="1JN 5:6">1 Yo 5.6</ref></char></note> Kristusue nikoure xonikisuwoteneai ene iserinikati nupo ekero asinaku teteiwoteneai. Panumu kapiae nukoe Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai ikou xetai. <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>Nukoe<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:2">2 Ko 11.2</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:4">Ep 1.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:22">Kl 1.22</ref></char></note> nukou ekeroni kutu Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu atinikati xiri xoseiyeri, panumu xunu xeika kesi xeika tukuxepuwatixe. Xuwe. Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai paiya xu xuweu xeseu puropineri. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Panumu sie tini apu tini takipo muputikini xotikieukiriai sie, tini takipo xuimi xotikienika. Apue nukou xui xiri xouwewotai paiya, nu nukoini nuko xiri xouweuna. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Siko sipa, kire apue nukou mupokemuni xiwairouwatixe. Xuwe. Nu xoye tuna ati yakurouna. Kristusue nukoure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu yakunikirouna sie, <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>pa amure<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:5">Ro 12.5</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 6:15">1 Ko 6.15</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:27">12.27</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Ep 1.22-23</ref></char></note>, siko paiya Kristusupo mupokemupo siau xeika xupo xeika ekekemu xeika sie. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>Xoiteupo nakaue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Stt 2.24</ref>;<ref loc="MAT 19:5">Mt 19.5</ref>;<ref loc="MRK 10:7-8">Mk 10.7-8</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 6:16">1 Ko 6.16</ref></char></note> ipaki kunauna, “Pa xati apue omo ana wetina nupo xui xeika lixirouna, kakina nini kireni mupuniki sairouneri,” xetai. <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Mua<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.32-33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:19">Kl 3.19</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 3:6">1 Pi 3.6</ref>;<ref loc="REV 19:7">XKY 19.7</ref></char></note> ximiaropu kuna paiya nu kokaipa nanunanu tuku. Ye ikoni nanune, paiya Kristusu xeika nukoure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapu xeikaure kunaunaxine. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Pana mua kunae rania kunauna tini apu kireni kirenie takire xirounuku sieni tinipo xui xiri xotikienika. Xui paiya nupo xamu irue purina ati yakuwopina.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Polue nono xeika eminikimana aninikimana xeikaure kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 23:22">Asin 23.22</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:20">Kl 3.20</ref></char></note> nonomi, Xoiteue xouweiwotai kapia tinie emitikimana xeika anitikimana xeika nikau kunani kutu taiwa. Tini panumu kapia kakinaria, tini asinaku kapia kakinuku. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>Xoiteupo nakaue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:4">Mt 15.4</ref></char></note> ipaki kunauna, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">XT 20.12</ref>;<ref loc="DEU 5:16">Tu 5.16</ref></char></note>“Ne eminianinipo kuna tainau nini irue puro,” xetai. Mua tuxotapa paiya akereki tuxotapa sokisoki kuna xeika purina, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>paiya sokisoki kunae ipaki kunauna, “Ne panumu kakinaua, xokupa saina sie kakitiai asinaku xatia, ne mua ouro xuwau yause purowai,” xetai.<verse eid="EPH 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:9">Tu 4.9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:7">6.7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:20-25">6.20-25</ref>;<ref loc="PSA 78:4">Siri 78.4</ref>;<ref loc="PRO 19:18">Asin 19.18</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:6">22.6</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:21">Kl 3.21</ref></char></note> eminikimana, tini kakixanari niretikimana nikau nanunanu xoxixoxiwaku. Panumu nini kisamairanikexete. Xuwe. Tini Kokaipa ekero asinaku kapia kakinari, tinipo nono atinari kutunikinari Xoiteupo kuna xosa taitainika.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Polue saina apu xeika tumu xeikaure kunawotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 7:15">2 Ko 7.15</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 2:12">Pl 2.12</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 2:9-10">Ta 2.9-10</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 2:18">1 Pi 2.18</ref></char></note> aipu saina xuimiapimi, tinie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5-8</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:22-25">Kl 3.22-25</ref></char></note> tinipo saina yayaku kokaipaure nanunari ninipo kuna taiwa. Tini kakixanari xoreire pa kapia kakaku. Xuwe. Tini Kristusupo kuna iyesinuku tairounuku sieni ninipo kuna xiri taiwakuai. <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>Ninie tini nutietiki purori ai niraniranikinari ekiniki tepure nanuwori asinaku saina taku. Pa xuwe. Tinie ipaki nanunaria sini Kristusupo aipu saina apuni purinukuxinari, Xoiteupo nanunanu taiwopure xotikikemu nimaririwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>Pa xati tini xotikikemu nimaririrei saina ta. Tini apu nikau saina tarixe. Xuwe. Tini Kokaipa nukou sainani tinuku. <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>Tini nanuwa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Ko 5.10</ref>;<ref loc="GAL 3:28">Ka 3.28</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:11">Kl 3.11</ref></char></note>. Kire apu nu aipu saina apure e nu somo purotaie asinaku saina tatia, Kokaipae nu asinaku xe tuwopina.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Tu 10.17</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 2:11">Ro 2.11</ref>;<ref loc="COL 3:25">Kl 3.25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:1">4.1</ref></char></note> saina yayuku teu, tinie rania tinipo aipu saina apimi xosa asinaku kapia kaka. Tinie nini ximikepineri kapia kakaku. Mena xouro purotai Kokaipa paiya nu tinipo Kokaipa nini rania ninipo Kokaipa, nu kireni kapiareini xokupa xuiapu nikau kapia uteirouna.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesusure xonikisuwoteneai xuiapue xomatua sie purineri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Paina<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:13">1 Ko 16.13</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 1:19">Ep 1.19</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 3:16">3.16</ref>;<ref loc="COL 1:11">Kl 1.11</ref></char></note> muaia yeu kuna ipaki xuweiyepure xine, tini Kokaipa xeika lixikiriai, pa xati tini nupo xokupa kokaipa sokisokire nanunari tini sokisoki tumuwa. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:12">Ro 13.12</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 6:7">2 Ko 6.7</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 10:4">10.4</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 4:14">Ep 4.14</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Ts 5.8</ref></char></note> Xoiteue xokupa xomapu nekei sikirouna nekei nekeiyerinari, sokisoki tumunaria Satanie ximiakina kakirouna xokupa xoreixorei kapia sokau porowakuai. <verse eid="EPH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Atinari nanuwa<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yo 12.31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:30">14.30</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 8:38">Ro 8.38</ref>;<ref loc="1CO 15:50">1 Ko 15.50</ref>;<ref loc="COL 2:15">Kl 2.15</ref>;<ref loc="1PE 5:8-9">1 Pi 5.8-9</ref></char></note>, sini xuiapu xeika waraxiroukirixe. Xuwe. Sini xokupa tumu teu xouro puroteneai xeika, kokaipa weniniki tuku yaniyani xeika, xokupa sapi sokisoki xeika waraxinuku, ninie ukumupo yause xosa ou yakurouneri. Pa xeika xokupa sokisoki xoxixoxi yaniyani xouro puroteneai xeika rania sini waraxinuku. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Pa xati<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 10:4">2 Ko 10.4</ref>;<ref loc="EPH 5:16">Ep 5.16</ref></char></note> tini Xoiteue xokupa xuiapu xoma xakuai nekei tikirouna tinari xoxi yause xosa tini sokisoki tumunari xoma xakuai. Kakinari xoma xuwexatia, tini sokisoki tumunaria purakuai.<verse eid="EPH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:5">Ais 11.5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59.17</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 6:7">2 Ko 6.7</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Ts 5.8</ref></char></note> sokisoki tumuwopurexinari paiya suau kuna tinipo kikai sie takerinari, kutu asinaku kapiae marimasa sokisoki sie tototikiro ererari xotorepina, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>kakinari<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:9">Ais 40.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:7">52.7</ref>;<ref loc="NAM 1:15">Na 1.15</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 10:15">Ro 10.15</ref></char></note> Xoiteupo xuiapu xonikikemu tumaxepurexetaire asinaku kuna uteinari ireinaria, tinipo erieri sie pa kapia erera. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:4">1 Yo 5.4</ref></char></note> pa xokupa xomaxakuai sapi tinari, xotikisuwopi kapia rania, kupira masa sie sokisoki tinari paiya, pa apu xoxi Satanie xokupa xepi xori piti xati tini xosa kourouna xukuwakuai. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:2">Ais 49.2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:17">59.17</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:8">1 Ts 5.8</ref>;<ref loc="HEB 4:12">Ip 4.12</ref>;<ref loc="REV 19:15">XKY 19.15</ref></char></note> Xoiteue xiyeri titiketaire nanunanuwari, pa nanunanue koike kapa kuroreki sie xepina. Kakinari Xoiteupo Supo Youyapu saripripiri nu Xoiteupo kuna takuai. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Tini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:41">Mt 26.41</ref>;<ref loc="LUK 18:1">Lu 18.1</ref>;<ref loc="ROM 12:12">Ro 12.12</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:2">Kl 4.2</ref>;<ref loc="1TH 5:17">1 Ts 5.17</ref>;<ref loc="1TI 2:1">1 Ti 2.1</ref></char></note> sipesi Xoiteupo Supo Youyapu sokisokirei kunikuniwa. Kakinari Xoiteue tianitikepinaure nu kotounari xonuxonu kunikuni kunikuniwa. Tini sipesi sosopa epinari tini panumu kapia wetakuaixe. Tini kakixanari arikaku. Xoiteue nupo xokupa xuiapu tianikepinaure tini sipesi kunikuninari Xoiteu kotowakuai. <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Kakinari<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:29">YT 4.29</ref>;<ref loc="2CO 3:12">2 Ko 3.12</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:3-4">Kl 4.3-4</ref>;<ref loc="2TH 3:1">2 Ts 3.1</ref></char></note> ye rania Xoiteu kotounari tianiya. Tini panumu kakinari kunikuniwaria, Xoiteue yeu supiro kuna iyaratia ye ximikepi wetinei asinaku kunapu ximiaropu kuna xiri uteiwopine. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>Yei mua asinaku kuna uteiwopineure Xoiteu nukoini<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:20">2 Ko 5.20</ref>;<ref loc="PHP 1:20">Pl 1.20</ref>;<ref loc="PHM 1:9-10">Pm 9-10</ref></char></note> xesayati xoutiai xati, ye pa xotapaure kakauya xosa purine. Ye kuna uteiwopine saina tuku, pa xati tinie Xoiteu xosa kunikuniwari ye sokisoki yatia ximikepi wetinei xuiapu xosa sokisoki kunawopine.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nini tianikepinaure Polue Xoiteu kotowotai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Yei xokupa saina titiaire Tikikusie<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">YT 20.4</ref>;<ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kl 4.7-8</ref>;<ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Ti 4.12</ref>;<ref loc="TIT 3:12">Ta 3.12</ref></char></note> tini xakumetikepina. Tikikusi<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:7-8">Kl 4.7-8</ref></char></note> nu sikou xatasikini kutu, nu Kokaipapu asinaku saina apuni kutu. <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Sinipo puropi purikiriai tini sipawakuaire, yei tini xosa nu xesauti utuna, nu utuna paiya tinipo xotikikemu sokisokiwopina.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Xoiteu Emisiki xeika Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xeikae tini xatasikimana tikau xotikikemu yorowatia kuruwopina, nue kakatia tini sokisoki xotikisunaria kireu apimi xotikienikakuai. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Xokupa apue sikou Kokaipa Yesusu Kristusu xiri xonikiewopi kapia wetepu xuweurouneri paiya, Xoiteue<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:8">1 Pi 1.8</ref></char></note> nini xosa xouwenikina xousuaxepi kapia kakepina.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
